'''Slime''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 2nd tier in the Main Event during the [[Halloween Event 2018|2018 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Slime is a reskin of the [[Default Knife]]. It has green slime plastered over nearly the entire blade, and part of the handle and guard.

==Trivia== 
*It has a [[Slime (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name, making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Slime_Set Slime Set].
* There was a bug where if players equipped the [[Knifeception]] effect with this knife, small images of its decal would appear instead. However, this has since been patched.

